      "value": "Same issue here — the Frosted Scribe doesn't sync at all, position included, and nothing I write is visible to other players. Feels the same as what Matrixes described, like sync is completely broken and it only works locally. Happens regardless of whether it was stolen/picked up. Would appreciate a fix, it's basically unusable around others right now.",
